The original Thomas system is Copyright 1992 Digital Equipment Corporation;
this Common Lisp translation is Copyright 2026 Blake McBride and is a
derivative work of it.  Digital's terms govern the whole, and its notice
appears at the head of every file here, as it did on every file of the
Scheme original.  The full text, together with a summary of what it permits
and what it does not, is in ../LICENSE.

In brief: it allows use, modification, and redistribution at no charge to
recipients who accept the same terms, but not sale or transfer for
